
### ToText Method
When changing a column type causes errors, convert to text first before changing to the target type. This prevents Power Query from trying to interpret ambiguous values directly.

```m
// Step 1 — convert to text first
= Table.TransformColumnTypes(Source, {{"column_name", type text}})

// Step 2 — then convert to your target type
= Table.TransformColumnTypes(#"Previous Step", {{"column_name", type date}})
```

